<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPANISH CLUBS MOST EXPENSIVE SIGNINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPANISH CLUBS MOST EXPENSIVE SIGNINGS.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 10 most expensive signings</p>
<p>made by Spanish clubs since the end of last season following</p>
<p>move of Roberto Rios to Athletic Bilbao (in millions of</p>
<p>dollars):</p>
<p>Juninho - Middlesbrough to Atletico Madrid 19.5</p>
<p>Christian Vieri - Juventus to Atletico Madrid 17.5 </p>
<p>Roberto Rios - Real Betis to Athletic Bilbao 13.5</p>
<p>Djalminha - Palmeiras to Deportivo 10.0</p>
<p>Jordi Lardin - Espanyol to Atletico Madrid 7.6</p>
<p>Marcelinho Carioca - Corinthians to Valencia 7.5</p>
<p>Oliverio 'Oli' Alvarez - Oviedo to Real Betis 7.3</p>
<p>Fernando Morientes - Real Zaragoza to Real Madrid 6.6</p>
<p>Roy Makaay - Vitesse Arnhem to Tenerife 6.6</p>
<p>Palhinha - Cruzeiro to Real Mallorca 6.6</p>
</text>
